#: sds.advanced.hash_table.HashTableOpenAddressing.put:3
msgid ""
"Probes linearly from the home slot. If *key* already exists its value is "
"updated; otherwise the entry is placed in the first available slot (empty"
" or tombstone). Triggers a resize when the live load factor exceeds "
"``max_load_factor``."
msgstr ""

#: 4dbb1f441e92461f88e15fbbb60c7c0a of
#: sds.advanced.hash_table.HashTableOpenAddressing.delete:3
msgid ""
"Marks the slot with a tombstone (``_DELETED``) so that probing chains "
"remain intact. Tombstones are cleared on the next resize."
msgstr ""

